This project borrows designs, and in a few places small pieces of code,
from the following open-source projects. Where code was adapted, the file
carries a comment saying so. We err on the side of acknowledging.

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Infisical CLI, packages/agentproxy
https://github.com/Infisical/cli
Copyright (c) 2025 Infisical Inc.
MIT License (content outside any "ee/" directory; nothing under "ee/" was used)

Adapted: the connection-limiting listener and one-shot listener shapes
(internal/proxy/server.go, internal/proxy/inspect.go); the HTTP/1.1-only
upstream transport with an empty TLSNextProto map (internal/proxy/server.go);
leaf certificate details: P-256, DNS vs IP SAN, lifetime capped at the
issuer's expiry, bounded cache (internal/ca/ca.go); TRACE/TRACK rejection
and pinning the request Host to the tunnel destination
(internal/proxy/forward.go); the list of certificate and proxy environment
variables to set for a child process (internal/childenv/childenv.go).

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Infisical Agent Vault
https://github.com/Infisical/agent-vault
Copyright (c) 2022 Infisical Inc.
MIT License (content outside any "ee/" directory; nothing under "ee/" was used)

Adapted: the SSRF-resistant dialer that resolves once, rejects if any DNS
answer is a blocked address, and dials the vetted IP (internal/netguard);
the WebSocket upgrade handling: substitute on the handshake, then splice
(internal/proxy/forward.go); building the audit event before substitution
so it structurally cannot contain a secret (internal/proxy/forward.go).

------------------------------------------------------------------------

inflightsec/agent-vault-proxy ("kow")
https://github.com/inflightsec/agent-vault-proxy
Apache License 2.0

Ideas only, no code: substituting a placeholder only in the one declared
slot; per-binding method and path restrictions; decrypting only hosts that
carry a secret and passing the rest through; a strict config schema where
unknown keys are errors.

------------------------------------------------------------------------

stashbase/agent-proxy
https://github.com/stashbase/agent-proxy
Copyright (c) 2026 Stashbase, s.r.o.
MIT License

Ideas only, no code: the binding shape (secret, hosts, header, env var);
whole-header exact matching; keeping credential-free egress hosts separate
from binding hosts.

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Apoxy CLRK
https://github.com/apoxy-dev/clrk
AGPL-3.0

Read for reference only. No code or design elements were copied; CLRK's
license is incompatible with this project and its approach (unconditional
header overwrite via Envoy) differs from ours.

